# Comment and Response.

**Authors:** 

## Abstract
Presents responses to three &quot;College English&quot; articles, C.H. Knoblauch and Lil Brannon's &quot;Writing as Learning through the Curriculum&quot; (September 1983), Helen Schwartz's &quot;Monsters and Mentors&quot; (February 1982), and James C. Raymond's &quot;Rhetoric: The Methodology of the Humanities&quot; (December 1982). Includes the authors' rebuttals. (MM)

